        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e6514477-cbea-554b-b4ca-fa62ed472872",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Franco, Aron Ralston, Sam Raimi\n- Films: 127 Hours, Milk, Pineapple Express, Rise of the Planet of the Apes, Spring Breakers, Oz the Great and Powerful, This Is the End, The Disaster Artist, The Little Prince, Sausage Party, Spider-Man trilogy\n- Places: Blue John Canyon, southeastern Utah\n- Topics: film roles, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- In April 2003, Aron Ralston became trapped by a boulder in an isolated slot canyon in Blue John Canyon, southeastern Utah.\n- The film 127 Hours stars James Franco as Aron Ralston, a canyoneer.\n- James Franco is known for roles in the films Milk and Pineapple Express, both released in 2008.\n- James Franco is also known for roles in Sam Raimi's Spider-Man trilogy.\n- James Franco is known for roles in Rise of the Planet of the Apes in 2011 and Spring Breakers in 2012.\n- James Franco is known for roles in Oz the Great and Powerful and This Is the End, both released in 2013.\n- James Franco voiced characters in The Little Prince in 2015 and Sausage Party in 2016.\n- James Franco is known for a role in The Disaster Artist, released in 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
